# Dataset folder
# Note: src/ folder is tracked (source code)
# For dataset/, you may want to track the structure but ignore large files
# Uncomment the lines below if you want to ignore image files in dataset:
# dataset/images/**/*.jpg
# dataset/images/**/*.jpeg
# dataset/images/**/*.png
# dataset/images/**/*.gif
# dataset/images/**/*.bmp
# dataset/images/**/*.tiff
# dataset/images/**/*.tif
# Or ignore entire dataset folder:
# dataset/

